spec:
  id: skill_progression
  version: 1.0.0
  status: stable
  priority: highest
  module: Curriculum
  compiler_stage: Skill Development
  description: >
purpose[5]: develop,assess,reinforce,evolve,engineering skills.
philosophy[6]: Skills grow through practice.,Mastery requires repetition.,Complexity increases gradually.,Experience compounds.,Engineering maturity,develops over time.
pipeline[11]: Learn,→,Practice,→,Apply,→,Improve,→,Generalize,→,Master
levels[6]: Novice,Beginner,Intermediate,Advanced,Expert,Principal
novice[4]: Follow Instructions,Recognize Syntax,Execute Examples,Learn Terminology
beginner[4]: Modify Examples,Solve Simple Problems,Debug Basic Errors,Explain Concepts
intermediate[4]: Build Projects,Optimize Code,Analyze Tradeoffs,Read Large Codebases
advanced[4]: Design Systems,Mentor Others,Evaluate Architectures,Handle Production Issues
expert[4]: Cross Domain Reasoning,Predict Failures,Optimize Organizations,Create New Patterns
principal[4]: Engineering Vision,Technical Leadership,Organization Scale Design,Long Term Strategy
categories[10]: Programming,Algorithms,Systems,Architecture,Debugging,Testing,Security,Performance,Communication,Leadership
dimensions[7]: Knowledge,Reasoning,Execution,Communication,Decision Making,Independence,Adaptability
capabilities[6]: Accuracy,Speed,Reliability,Complexity,Creativity,Explainability
practice[5]: Guided,Independent,Collaborative,Project Based,Production Based
mastery[6]: Explain,Implement,Debug,Optimize,Teach,Generalize
regression[4]: Detect Skill Decay,Detect Forgotten Concepts,Reinforce Weak Skills,Schedule Review
transfer[12]: Programming,→,Systems,Systems,→,Distributed Systems,Algorithms,→,AI,Security,→,Infrastructure
evaluation[5]: Practical Tasks,Code Review,Architecture Review,Incident Handling,Design Interview
memory[4]: Reinforce Successful Skills,Track Weak Skills,Record Milestones,Store Experience
ekr:
  description: Every Engineering Knowledge Record
  stores[4]: Skill Level,Required Competencies,Mastery Evidence,Capability Improvements
validation[6]: Every skill,has measurable criteria.,Every level,builds upon previous levels.,Every progression,requires demonstrated capability.
examples:
  Example_01:
    Skill: Debugging
    Progression[7]: Read Stack Trace,→,Reproduce Bug,→,Root Cause Analysis,→,Prevent Recurrence
  Example_02:
    Skill: Architecture
    Progression[7]: Understand Components,→,Design Modules,→,Design Systems,→,Optimize Organizations
  Example_03:
    Skill: Performance
    Progression[7]: Measure,→,Profile,→,Optimize,→,Predict Bottlenecks
metrics[6]: Skill Growth Rate,Mastery Percentage,Practice Coverage,Capability Score,Transfer Score,Engineering Maturity
success[5]: Engineering skills,evolve systematically,from foundational competence,to expert judgment,through measurable progression.
guarantees[5]: Progressive Skill Growth,Measurable Competence,Transferable Expertise,Lifelong Improvement,Engineering Readiness
future:
  adaptive_skill_paths: true
  competency_prediction: true
  personalized_progression: true
  organization_skill_models: true
  autonomous_skill_assessment: true
